          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yesu yaabeeta y'ali, yaakoba ati: “Mwidhi ng'abafuzi abamaghanga agandi bagafuga, era n'abakulu baibwe baba n'obuyinza ku banaibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.25",
